- Detection screenshots
- Video frame examples
- Final report (PDF)

---

## Conclusion

Fine-tuning YOLO on a traffic sign dataset significantly improves small object detection performance. Increasing image resolution from 640 to 1280 provided the best results for detecting small distant traffic signs.